{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","火力全开"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","为累计造成伤害最高的友军提升攻击力和急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，备战时呼金会在自身位置摆放锻造台，并在战斗中总是会前往锻造台所在位置普通攻击和释放技能；主动释放时，为累计造成伤害最高的友军锻造机械齿轮，使其攻击力提升，提升值等同于呼金6% + 1%的基础攻击力，且急速提高80点，持续10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至7% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至8% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至9% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至10% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","神奇盾甲"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军锻造齿轮护甲，使其获得可抵御600% + 60% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至620% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至640% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至660% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","齿轮链接"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","身后一格的友军提升攻击力，还会在呼金释放“神奇盾甲”时恢复能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，呼金在身后一格布置机械联动装置。处于联动装置之上的友军的攻击力获得提升，提升值等同于呼金14% + 2%的基础攻击力，还会在呼金释放\"神奇盾甲\"时，获得传导的动能，额外回复75点能量。该效果在友军离开联动装置后消失。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backonehex"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至16% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至18% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至20% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","守护之谊"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，为最虚弱的2名友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，额外为最虚弱的2名友军锻造改良型齿轮护甲，使其获得可抵御800% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至850%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得改良型齿轮护甲提供的护盾的友军在持续期间内免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至900%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","护盾持续期间受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","齿轮护甲持续期间，还会使这名友军受到伤害降低30%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","淬火流金"]]}